  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "The Fresh Connection presents Dante's Inferno, a premium 3.5g flower offering that brings the heat to your cannabis experience. This carefully cultivated bud delivers a bold, memorable experience that lives up to its fiery name. Dante's Inferno showcases dense, resinous flower with a complex aroma profile featuring earthy, spicy, and pungent notes that ignite the senses. Each nug is hand-selected and expertly cured to preserve potency and flavor. Whether you're seeking relaxation after a long day or looking to unwind with friends, this strain delivers consistent quality in every session. The Fresh Connection's commitment to craft cultivation shines through in every aspect of this flower, from its rich terpene profile to its smooth, flavorful smoke. Perfect for experienced enthusiasts who appreciate premium cannabis flower with character and depth.",
